	(text "SUP_OPEN high: 2N7002 sinks EN. MCU dead or Hi-Z: pull-up opens the banks. The FET only sinks, so firmware cannot close an open loop.\nCat 1 option: remove the 0R, fit the four DNP parts, 289 ms nominal (232-356 ms). DNP in rev A: Cat 0.\nNot Cat 3: one series loop feeds both channels, a wiring short across it defeats both."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 292.1 170 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "56ace3a5-1730-562d-bda3-0feadaf719e6")
	)
	(text "Fans, 12 V, 25 kHz PWM open drain (polarity inverts in firmware)."
